      {
        "Id": "35e30e1a39aa4306b85218923f8e8661",
        "Title": "HOW TO USE\n1. In Revit select NOTHING = all columns, or select some columns / footings = only those.\n2. Set sizes in groups 1-3, switch PLACE / UPDATE on for what you want.\n3. Press Run (bottom left). Re-run any time - existing footings / beams are UPDATED, never duplicated.\n4. Change one beam: select it in Revit, use group 5.  Undo everything: group 6 REMOVE = True, Run.\nFooting is never smaller than column + projection.  Results: REPORT + %APPDATA%\\pyRevit\\CAD2BIM_dynamo_log.txt",
        "DescriptionText": null,
        "IsExpanded": true,
        "WidthAdjustment": 0.0,
        "HeightAdjustment": 0.0,
